@cc [owner:tdraier,label:security;product] agent-observability-for-fetchable-agents
These routes MUST serve an agent's observability aggregates (feedback counts and distribution,
version markers) to every caller `AgentResource.fetchById` returns the agent to, including a
workspace manager who only holds `list` on a hidden agent, and MUST return a 404 otherwise. They
MUST NOT return anything beyond these aggregates, such as feedback content or the agent's
configuration.
